      "content": "thanks. but the way i want to frame it is that gentle parenting isn't just \"a perspective,\" it's actually scientifically flawed and causes long-term damage. can u give me some more specific, hard-hitting points that show why it's objectively a bad way to raise kids? like, help me make the case that it's actually harmful rather than just a different style.",
